      "body": "B.R.Goyal Infrastructure Limited announced a private placement to issue 11,00,000 Convertible Warrants at an issue price of INR 29.75 for the proceeds of INR 32,725,000 on May 30, 2026. Transaction involves participation of Henal Mayank Mamania for 100,000 warrant, Mavira AMC LLP for 100,000 warrant, Hemangi Sushil Bheda for 100,000,  Sonal R Karani  for 200,000, Shailesh Lahoti for 100,000 and other investors.  The exercise price of warrant is INR 89.25, and Warrants are convertible into Equity Share within 18 months from the date of Allotment of Warrants. Transaction is approved by board of directors and is subject to approval of shareholders and regulatory authority.",
